  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>192</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>192</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>192</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>384</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>terms</mi></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>480</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>480</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math>equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>480</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>384</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>480</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>384</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>480</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>384</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>96</mn></math></p>"
